# Keep the build context to the Go tree.
#
# data/ alone is ~34 MB of committed season captures that no build step reads,
# and `reports` is a symlink to a directory outside the repository. Docker will
# not follow a symlink out of the build context, but excluding it explicitly
# means nobody has to know that to be sure of it.
.git
.github
.claude
reports
data
stats
reviews
docs
.cache
*.html
*.md
config.json
